---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Disclaimer"
  description="Institutional disclaimer and project disclosures for the Assamese Manuscript Archive and Samaguri Satra digital initiative."
  keywords="disclaimer, project disclosures, ASTEC funding, Girijananda Chowdhury University, Samaguri Satra, cultural archive disclaimer"
>
  <div class="py-28 px-4 sm:px-8 md:px-24 lg:px-40 max-w-5xl mx-auto">
    <div class="mb-12 text-center">
      <h1 class="font-display text-4xl md:text-5xl text-ink font-medium mb-4">
        Disclaimer
      </h1>
      <p class="text-body text-sm text-muted">
        Last Updated: September 30, 2026
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-8 text-body leading-relaxed bg-[var(--color-bg-elevated)] p-8 sm:p-12 rounded-2xl border border-[var(--color-hairline)] shadow-sm">
      <section>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl text-ink font-semibold mb-3">1. Academic &amp; Institutional Funding Disclosure</h2>
        <p>
          The <strong>Assamese Manuscript Archive</strong> is an outcome of the research project entitled <em>"Journey Through Assam’s Vaishnavite Manuscript Paintings: Bridging Heritage and Tourism with Digital Innovation."</em> This initiative is generously funded under the <strong>Innovation, Technology Generation and Awareness (ITGA)</strong> scheme of the <strong>Assam Science Technology and Environment Council (ASTEC)</strong>, Government of Assam.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl text-ink font-semibold mb-3">2. Collaborative Custodianship</h2>
        <p>
          This project is an institutional partnership between <strong>Girijananda Chowdhury University (GCU), Assam</strong> and <strong>Chamaguri Sattra (Samaguri Satra), Majuli</strong>. The digital documentation, photography, audio guide narration, and QR code implementation are conducted with deep respect and full consent of the spiritual and cultural custodians of the Sattra.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl text-ink font-semibold mb-3">3. Educational &amp; Non-Commercial Intent</h2>
        <p>
          The materials hosted on this website are published strictly for educational, scholarly, preservation, and cultural tourism enrichment purposes. No content is intended for commercial monetization.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl text-ink font-semibold mb-3">4. Historical &amp; Interpretive Accuracy</h2>
        <p>
          Every effort is made by the academic team (led by Principal Coordinator Dr. Nilakshi Goswami and Co-Principal Investigator Dr. Shrabani Medhi) to ensure scholarly precision in dating, transcribing, and contextualizing Vaishnavite manuscripts and mask traditions. Interpretations reflect established academic research in Assamese literature, manuscriptology, and cultural history.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
